@startgantt gantt
'==============================================================================
' Figure (Chapter IV, Engineering foundations and the delivery process):
' project timeline of the internship as a Gantt chart, with sub-phases.
'
' PRESENTATION CALENDAR (set by the author; revised 2026-08-04):
'   - Phase 0 -- Foundations:        second half of April 2026
'   - Phase 1 -- MVP:                May + first half of June
'   - Phase 2 -- Enterprise tier:    second half of June + July (pilot
'     complete end of July)
'   - August to end of September:    audit + maintenance of the platform,
'     and writing of the present report
' Sub-phases follow the roadmap's section structure:
'   - Phase 0: repositories/branching/CI-CD, dev environment, planning.
'   - Phase 1: backend (comby foundation + four core domains), web
'     application, production launch + hardening. The platform was in
'     production and re-released continuously well before the phase gate.
'   - Phase 2: document intelligence, custom fields + e-signature,
'     obligations + advanced reporting, testing and release.
' The former R&D section (planned work on the event-sourced core) was
' removed 2026-08-04 with the retirement of Chapter V -- perspectives-only;
' the closing section is now audit/maintenance + report writing.
' Render:  plantuml -tsvg gantt.puml  then  rsvg-convert -f pdf
'==============================================================================
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica

printscale weekly
Project starts 2026-04-05 ends 2026-09-25

